{"4":[{"k":"p","t":"GENERAL INFORMATION |"},{"k":"p","t":"[a Specific Requirements."},{"k":"p","t":"The Heavy Barrel game is a one or two player video game conversion kit. It is intended to be installed into an existing video game cabinet and comes with all the necessary components to make the converted game look and play like a new dedicated game!"},{"k":"p","t":"THE GAME TO BE CONVERTED MUST MEET THE FOLLOWING REQUIREMENTS"},{"k":"p","t":"MONITOR Vertical, RGB, negative Composite Sync input."},{"k":"p","t":"POWER SUPPLY + Svde @ 7 amp, +12 vde @ 1 amp, -Svdc @ .Samp (MIN)"},{"k":"p","t":"List of Materials."},{"k":"p","t":"DESCRIPTION PART NUMBER"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   PCB, HEAVY BARREL   510-0126-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   MAIN HARNESS, JAMMA, KIT   036-0158-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   JOYSTICK, 8 WAY, ROTARY   450-0012-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   PUSHBUTTON ASSY, YELLOW   350-0016-04"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   PUSHBUTTON ASSY, RED   350-0016-02"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   PUSHBUTTON, SHORT, GREY   350-0001-08"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   PUSHBUTTON HOLDER W/SWITCH   185-0001-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   PAL NUT, NYLON   240-0001-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   CNTRL PNL OVERLAY, HEAVY BARREL   800-0031-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   UNDERLAY CARD, HEAVY BARREL   810-0029-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   SIDE DECAL, GENERIC   820-0040-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   MARQUEE PLEX, HEAVY BARREL   830-0037-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   LABEL SET, PUSHBUTTON ID   406-0085-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   FCC WARNING LABEL   406-0003-00"},{"k":"tr","t":"|   MANUAL, INSTALLATION & SERVICE   780-0086-00"},{"k":"p","t":"PAGE 1 INSTALLATION & SERVICE MANUAL"}]}